  - [x] Validate unknown option handling.
  - [x] Validate missing value errors.
  - [x] Validate positional argument handling where applicable.
- [x] Acceptance criteria:
  - [x] make test-unit passes and exercises both long and short paths for each command.

Task 3 — Introduce XDG defaults and global path flags
- [x] Files:
  - [x] src/common.sh (defaults)
  - [x] src/main.sh (global flag parsing)
- [x] Edits in src/common.sh:
  - [x] Compute default_xdg_data_dir="${XDG_DATA_HOME:-$HOME/.local/share}".
  - [x] Default basePath to "${default_xdg_data_dir}/simple-ca" when basePath not set.
  - [x] Default exportDir to "${default_xdg_data_dir}/simple-ca/export" when exportDir not set.
  - [x] Default rootConfig and intermediateConfig to "${SCRIPT_DIR}/openssl-*.cnf" when not set.
  - [x] Ensure directories are created as needed (mkdir -p on use sites, not at import time) with restrictive permissions.
- [x] Edits in src/main.sh:
  - [x] Add global flags: --base-path <dir>, --export-dir <dir> (and optional short forms -B, -E if we want).
  - [x] After parsing, export basePath/exportDir so subcommands inherit.
  - [x] Update help text to mention XDG defaults and new global flags.
- [x] Acceptance criteria:
  - [x] Running scripts without any env produces CA under ~/.local/share/simple-ca by default.
  - [x] Global flags override defaults for all subcommands (e.g., simpleca --base-path /tmp/ca init).

Task 4 — Remove hard-coded /opt paths and make config writing unconditional
- [ ] Files:
  - [ ] src/request-server-cert.sh
  - [ ] src/init.sh
  - [ ] src/cert-manager.sh
- [ ] Edits:
  - [ ] Stop checking for basePath == "/opt/ca" to decide whether to generate per-run openssl config; always generate configs using rootCAPath/intermediatePath.
  - [ ] Replace any remaining /opt/export assumptions with exportDir.
  - [ ] Ensure copy/permissions in issue/validate respect exportDir and do not assume /opt.
- [ ] Acceptance criteria:
  - [ ] No /opt/ references remain in code paths except Dockerfile ENV and comments.
  - [ ] issue/validate work with XDG defaults and with custom --base-path/--export-dir.

Task 5 — Preserve Docker compatibility
- [ ] Files:
