Verification steps
- [ ] Host (no Docker):
  - [ ] rm -rf ~/.local/share/simple-ca
  - [ ] ./src/main.sh init (or bin/simpleca init)
  - [ ] ./src/main.sh issue --cn test.local --sans DNS:test.local
  - [ ] Confirm files under ~/.local/share/simple-ca
- [ ] Container:
  - [ ] make docker-test
  - [ ] docker run --rm -e basePath=/opt/ca -e exportDir=/opt/export simpleca:latest version

Out-of-scope but noted
- Consider permissions of exported files (avoid chmod 776; prefer 644/600) — can be addressed in a later hardening pass.
- Consider adding a config file under XDG_CONFIG_HOME for defaults.
